        "id": 12505,
        "name": "metlarcturus",
        "username": "metlarcturus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/{size}/2210_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-01T03:53:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What is the consensus on when the game actually ends upon the destruction of the villain? For example, will hit-backs like Backlash Field or the Chairman's ability activate when the villain is reduced to 0 or fewer HP (assuming all other conditions for victory have been fulfilled)?</p>\n<p>According to the Handelabra/Christopher fireside chat,</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If the Wraith has Combat Stance in play and is incapacitated by damage, Combat Stance is removed from play before its effect can occur.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>However, in my experiments with the digital version of Sentinels, this rule doesn't apply to villains: both Ambuscade (with Reactive Plating) and Baron Blade (with Backlash Field) still get to strike back after being reduced to 0 or fewer HP. This makes it possible for<em> all</em> the characters, villain and hero, to be incapacitated/destroyed (which results in a villain victory, apparently).</p>\n<p>At what point do you check for victory? And why do only villains seem to get a pass on striking back from the grave?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:04.077Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 12504,
        "topic_slug": "villain-destruction-question",
        "display_username": "metlarcturus",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
